          "_name": "footer7",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer7\" group=\"Footers\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-reveal': reveal, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reveal effect\" name=\"reveal\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background5.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#232323\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row align-center mbr-white\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".media-container-row .mbr-text\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><a href=\"Privacy-Policy.html\" class=\"text-white\">Privacy Policy</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"Terms-and-Conditions.html\" class=\"text-white\" target=\"_blank\">Terms &amp; Conditions</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"Disclaimer.html\" class=\"text-white\">Disclaimer</a><br>\n<br>This site is not a part of the Facebook website or Facebook Inc. Additionally, This site is NOT endorsed by Facebook in any way. FACEBOOK is a trademark of FACEBOOK, Inc.\n<br>\n<br><b>FDA Compliance:</b>&nbsp;The information on this website has not been evaluated by the Food &amp; Drug Administration or any other regulatory body. We do not aim to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any skin conditions or diseases. The content is provided for educational purposes only. You should always consult a dermatologist or healthcare professional before using any skincare products or following any skincare advice, especially if you have sensitive skin, allergies, or underlying medical conditions.&nbsp;Results May Vary: Skincare results and testimonials featured on this site are not a guarantee of specific outcomes. Individual results may vary based on factors such as skin type, genetics, environmental influences, and skincare routine.&nbsp;Some names and personal identifying details have been changed to protect privacy.&nbsp;No individual result should be considered typical.\n<br>\n<br>Enjoy &amp; Thank you!<br><br>© Copyright 2026<a href=\"https://rachelmorgans.com/home/\" class=\"text-white\">&nbsp;Rachel Morgan™ </a>- All Rights Reserved\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
