          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h1 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\"><b>\n                    Privacy Policy</b></h1>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Our Privacy Policy was last updated on [05-04-2026].\n<br>\n<br>Welcome to our Privacy Policy. We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring the security of your information. This Privacy Policy outlines the types of information collected and used by our organization. If you have any questions or need clarification about our Privacy Policy, please feel free to contact us. This Privacy Policy applies to our online activities and pertains to information collected on our website. Please note that this policy does not cover information collected offline or through other channels. Your Consent By using our website, you consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms. Information Collection We collect personal information when you provide it to us voluntarily. This may include your name, email address, phone number, and any other details you choose to share. When you register for an account, we may ask for additional information such as your contact details. Usage of Your Information We use the information we collect for various purposes, including providing and improving our services, communicating with you, and preventing fraud. Log Files We utilize log files to analyze trends, administer the site, and track users' movements on the website. This information is not linked to personally identifiable information. Privacy Policies of Advertising Partners Please refer to the Privacy Policies of our advertising partners for information on their practices. Third Party Privacy Policies Our Privacy Policy does not extend to other advertisers or websites. Please review the Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers for more information. CCPA Privacy Rights Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), California consumers have the right to request information about the categories of personal data collected and request deletion of their personal data. GDPR Data Protection Rights Under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), users have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict processing, object to processing, and data portability. Children's Information We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If you believe your child has provided such information, please contact us, and we will take appropriate action. If you have any questions or concerns about our Privacy Policy, please contact us.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
